### Office Viewer HTTP Client 测试文件
### 用法: 光标放在请求上按 Ctrl+Enter (Mac: Cmd+Enter) 发送

@host = https://httpbin.org
@token = test-token-123

### 1. GET 请求 + 环境变量
GET {{host}}/get?name=office-viewer&lang=zh HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json

### 2. GET 带自定义请求头
GET {{host}}/headers HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Custom-Header: office-viewer-test

### 3. POST JSON 请求体
POST {{host}}/post HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Office Viewer",
  "version": "4.2.0",
  "features": ["excel", "word", "ppt", "pdf"],
  "nested": {
    "enabled": true,
    "count": 42
  }
}

### 4. POST 表单
POST {{host}}/post HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=maizhuoying&role=admin&备注=中文表单值

### 5. 文件上传(选择实际存在的文件)
# @name upload
POST {{host}}/post HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

月份,销量
一月,1200
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### 6. 响应断言与重定向
# 与 REST Client 语法兼容
GET {{host}}/redirect-to?url=/get&status_code=302 HTTP/1.1

> {%
client.test("状态码为 200", function() {
  client.assert(response.status === 200, "期望 200");
});
%}

### 7. 同文件多个请求以 ### 分隔, 请求间可定义局部变量
@contentType = application/json

PUT {{host}}/put HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{"updated": true}
